"""Closed PR760 arithmetic provenance candidates, not source admission.

This pure staging leaf reads no files, accepts no root and emits no receipt.
Its exact inverses join the preserved common-758 and #738 endpoints. Named
body checks supplement those inverses; they do not claim general arithmetic
equivalence. Each physical owner must separately admit its complete source
image, resolver closure and caller premises. This pure leaf never grants
physical admission, regardless of the owning integration checkpoint.

The separately named four-file hair scope supplies exact provenance only.
Density-local proof consumers must retain their own physical source, provider,
test and caller-census ownership; this scope cannot admit a CARLA source image.
"""
